	(4210, 'Processo de Negociação de Orçamento / Novos Valores', 'COMERCIAL', 'Emultec', 'Setores envolvidos: Hospital/Convênio, Comercial Interno e Coordenação. Objetivo: Ajustar e validar valores orçados através de negociações entre a empresa e o cliente. Passo a Passo: 1. Observar orçamento. 2. Entrar no Sistema Emultec em Movimentos > Cirurgias. 3. Procurar paciente, e após isso, clicar em ''Material Utilizado Pós'' e verificar. 4. Apertar as teclas de uma vez: Fn + Alt + F9 > Produtos > Pesquisar o código do material e ver o custo.', '[-0.118864454,0.26791787,-0.23265322,-0.0844641,-0.083486475,0.0386458,0.052851707,0.039287224,-0.0529,0.095414005,0.01908994,0.012599502,0.057002813,-0.12147559,-0.03296005,-0.19570942,-0.112463966,-0.042284295,0.01882466,0.06776895,-0.100884706,-0.11143939,-0.16739616,-0.0069311345,-0.030542403,0.1880754,-0.11168653,-0.047708824,0.047580242,-0.28171724,0.15527603,-0.02210164,0.11933792,-0.047204435,0.19237618,0.048575323,0.068578765,-0.03473273,-0.13589463,0.076321475,-0.035684362,-0.18259256,-0.04408522,0.08411972,0.060458824,-0.12129241,-0.070071295,0.056941543,-0.2479174,0.23340645,-0.14628232,-0.23561597,-0.025266428,0.010159977,-0.023693502,0.2332364,0.27896428,-0.013323598,-0.19697209,-0.07183054,0.048738584,-0.005620604,-0.073264636,0.07936922,0.07965183,0.1831424,0.11576052,0.07159141,-0.000109016895,-0.061657228,-0.05519263,-0.19332379,-0.15278581,-0.13153708,0.043904383,0.033290654,0.058954507,0.08294168,0.10274785,-0.08179715,0.15278907,0.045654565,-0.026275992,-0.023139754,0.0015393123,0.048547592,0.13690054,0.16092949,0.08934334,-0.0028072447,0.19353288,0.027661033,-0.0068549467,-0.12143237,-0.12518562,0.080907725,-0.10853588,-0.0041083917,0.168528,0.39569196,0.0036217645,0.040843654,-0.03275671,-0.12914787,-0.037472606,0.008189537,-0.036427557,-0.043736756,0.11473954,-0.044952773,-0.17105845,0.17153127,-0.0944165,-0.2261891,0.10908187,0.21158552,-0.12969351,0.048261628,0.18681863,-0.007853687,0.024634168,0.09438178,0