	(4226, 'Processo de Análise de Pendência de Faturamento', 'FATURAMENTO', 'Emultec', 'Objetivo: Identificar cirurgias realizadas que ainda não foram faturadas. Fluxo Passo a Passo: 1. Abrir o Emultec. 2. Ir em Movimentos > Cirurgias > Cirurgias Finalizadas. 3. Clicar em Relatório finalizado. 4. Colocar data da cirurgia > Clicar em Gerar Excel. 5. Dentro do Excel filtrar pelos clientes.', '[-0.25851676,0.23303315,-0.047866423,-0.108614475,-0.25661016,-0.113034494,0.03355064,0.1100001,0.08491927,0.0565501,0.079486,0.02911226,0.14210145,-0.06700609,-0.4079325,-0.2656727,-0.11858487,-0.029980838,-0.044057228,-0.027651032,0.037965816,-0.078495055,0.05799761,0.025906436,0.062649615,0.15501794,0.017101765,0.022280483,-0.13022521,-0.3359335,0.0021480413,-0.07563761,0.045611706,-0.073476896,0.14210984,-0.02455436,-0.16992462,0.0803211,0.09569281,-0.01735967,-0.06296537,-0.23931147,-0.09333459,0.0064426884,0.20941807,-0.10621444,0.022176826,-0.13192637,-0.23104988,0.30873796,-0.15773496,-0.15448049,0.016677845,-0.0979645,0.106077425,0.03001739,0.018264005,-0.0064311866,-0.055863265,0.03970693,0.13387984,-0.052995432,-0.11563567,0.12431046,-0.06415965,0.14498582,0.26466587,-0.1102473,0.15490057,0.17856762,-0.23438375,-0.059972383,-0.12262265,-0.11056853,0.014378609,-0.028077744,-0.04347292,0.10690777,-0.115091115,-0.07121189,0.3758042,0.01972335,-0.23278831,0.08713892,0.108293116,-0.006990831,0.07114666,0.18868075,0.072767444,-0.25061908,0.23469335,-0.042087197,-0.16255352,-0.029039677,-0.03642411,0.09901168,-0.19456178,-0.02258143,0.19503525,0.23808153,-0.091348775,0.043609127,-0.03497738,0.06174206,0.043436073,0.00013470912,-0.043181147,-0.13941266,0.009582933,0.09898967,-0.05516593,0.10427253,0.12461962,-0.077852525,0.06685554,0.31579086,0.06773113,0.11611256,0.22631526,0.17552689,-0.051740468,-0.009560365,0.096059486,-0.0010366649,0.16212809,-0.14746866,0.02490444,-0.16814566,0.113868244,-0.3485047,0.15384993,0.028446138,-0.15747774,-0.00056911825,-0.045069713,-0.178989,0.