	(4247, 'Orçamento Prévio', 'ORÇAMENTO - MEDIC', 'WhatsApp / E-mail / Emultec / Gtplan', '1. Verificar plataformas(Whatsapp, Gmail, OMPnexo, Inpart, Gtplan, EMS). 2. No Gtplan ir em Cotações OPME > Limpar Filtros > Colocar UF > Pesquisar. 3. Se o status estiver em ''aberto'' cotar. 4. Copiar ID do paciente e seus dados. 5. Mandar para o representante da área para saber se vai cotar. 6. Se for para cotar: Abrir Emultec > Movimentos > Cirurgias > Cadastro > Clicar no ícone de papel e preencher os dados com base no portal. 7. Ir em Orçamentos > Clicar no icone de papel > Gera o ID de Orçamento > Adicionar produtos avulsos ou conjunto > Sincronizar com SysWeb. 8. Colocar ID do produto no Gtplan. 9. Finalizar proposta.', '[-0.18643337,0.121433854,-0.07821561,-0.015541494,0.0793045,0.1829806,-0.037601173,0.20210937,-0.12032168,0.13765061,-0.018055411,-0.045517948,0.08175362,0.068122886,-0.06958783,-0.31033134,-0.06354945,0.02507236,0.2504763,0.032954708,0.053555906,-0.051922902,0.17904416,-0.14570749,-0.14917767,0.21464403,-0.08928724,0.016805604,-0.04431452,-0.0944273,0.10236561,-0.0962428,0.057113454,0.0011206418,0.18382293,-0.084557496,0.004543555,0.11456876,-0.14449948,0.030261017,-0.03428431,-0.13602091,-0.064782895,0.13427474,0.12914374,-0.065234214,-0.1947165,-0.036073834,-0.09626898,0.18773602,-0.10735112,-0.14443073,0.040554114,0.051818818,-0.06440811,0.10605021,0.0049091056,-0.084102586,-0.07828381,0.14992976,-0.13939837,-0.08114441,-0.111996055,0.16466501,-0.04812366,0.2718843,0.2633749,-0.016225755,0.19880404,-0.20402741,-0.18805483,-0.084852844,-0.14558667,-0.031971514,0.0602739,0.14512321,0.035146907,0.08397424,0.24674022,-0.06940225,0.15473272,0.14655457,0.033845264,0.08937697,0.12428062,-0.033298023,0.031384166,0.16636586,-0.14460151,-0.110838555,0.19448186,-0.1075034,0.06171538,-0.027217008,-0.17948434,0.13315894,-0.1592485,-0.10488876,0.17445323,0.21955718,0.020333648,-0.09639579,-0.10707688,0.027668938,-0.025221772,0.01786878,0.1554394,-0.18545617,0.128