	(4258, 'Fluxo de Cadastro', 'ORÇAMENTO - ARTHROMED', 'Emultec', 'Objetivo: Garantir que hospitais, convênios e médicos estejam corretamente cadastrados no sistema. Cadastro de Hospital ou Convênio (Cliente): 1. Acessar: Cadastro > Clientes > Novo. 2. Inserir o CNPJ e clicar na bolinha de busca. 3. Conferir as informações. Se o cliente será faturado diretamente, marcar como Cliente Final. Se for hospital, é obrigatório vinculá-lo às cirurgias. Vinculação do Hospital às Cirurgias: 1. Acessar: Movimentos > Comercial. 2. Abrir qualquer cirurgia. 3. No cabeçalho, localizar o campo Hospital. 4. Clicar na lupa e importar o CNPJ. Cadastro apenas do Convênio: Convênios > Novo > Inserir nome e salvar. Cadastro de Médico: 1. Clicar na lupa ao lado do campo Médico. 2. Selecionar Novo. 3. Preencher obrigatoriamente: Nome, CRM, Cidade, Estado, Vendedor.', '[-0.08565482,0.116633594,-0.083563335,-0.2748437,-0.114516206,-0.13911788,-0.008863404,0.20565553,-0.017362392,0.06147854,-0.021690987,0.016852029,-0.015976686,0.053908385,-0.2597295,-0.19950855,-0.0361642,0.034408838,0.05259277,0.08861482,-0.06768953,-0.046471942,0.015874647,-0.08180885,-0.12707284,0.07898734,-0.18273948,-0.003035318,-0.041841894,-0.35915726,-0.0058788545,-0.07467775,0.041582644,-0.012680128,0.1413293,-0.13890532,-0.08092716,0.2217808,-0.029264748,0.053335182,-0.067983836,-0.11764765,0.0051578246,0.028531939,0.075933285,-0.03111875,-0.070477866,0.019864362,-0.1349048,0.2303635,-0.089945704,-0.1019408,0.031814814,0.22051607,0.049076244,0.15912293,0.00372985,-0.057058856,-0.070858456,0.11698681,0.20735976,-0.09097218,-0.124153614,0.14459611,0.00272315,0.051538646,0.056984797,0.018895702,0.05443728,0.14322072,-0.069701254,-0.035463642,-0.09362379,-0.018636188,0.034533728,-0.025559336,-0.012856893,0.11646514,-0.021640498,0.022603303,0.11273274,0.017524194,-0.06083384,-0.12012061,0.030372877,0.14670944,-0.008971281,0.15247929,-0.097012535,-0.24407415,-0.009513514,-0.05790007,0.14282924,-0.1318657,0.0050092936,0.09