	(4259, 'Fluxo de Agendamento de Cirurgias', 'ORÇAMENTO - ARTHROMED', 'Emultec', 'Objetivo: Registrar corretamente todos os agendamentos. 1. Acessar: Movimentos > Comercial > Novo. 2. Inserir todas as informações recebidas (Data, Hora, Parte do corpo, Tipo de cirurgia, Médico, Hospital, Convênio, Representante). Cirurgia Eletiva: Conferir se o agendamento está de acordo com a autorização > Marcar como Aprovado > Confirmar agendamento > Clicar no capacete para sincronização. Cirurgia de Urgência: Criar novo cadastro > Inserir informações > Marcar como Aprovado > Confirmar agendamento > Clicar no capacete. Se o markup (margem) estiver baixo, solicitar aprovação da coordenação.', '[0.013378341,0.14691564,-0.14864127,-0.08198665,-0.12352236,-0.03594032,0.015173605,0.055187136,-0.100127205,0.109155014,-0.010151207,0.080577075,0.05298093,0.030872732,-0.16344434,-0.1785958,-0.024123982,-0.11598201,0.013127726,0.034448884,0.012278706,-0.0339967,0.13498649,-0.060710505,-0.13386749,-0.051417887,-0.12473914,-0.032241635,-0.07967312,-0.32706133,0.08136218,-0.016942546,0.1793763,0.0057805404,0.13022584,0.017125675,-0.09279169,0.1750919,-0.024634205,0.112519205,-0.042818382,-0.26333252,-0.054527093,0.040596485,0.09284872,0.06769779,-0.13259242,-0.0114625245,-0.26240683,0.21043666,-0.17714977,-0.22442745,-0.045728274,0.12934056,0.11055979,0.04290936,0.021898301,0.031859044,-0.006400019,0.0949877,0.08989437,0.022164762,-0.12926066,0.16656737,-0.10600054,0.046179034,0.08036568,0.010031402,-0.0011362135,0.14358337,-0.0002471283,-0.015145257,-0.006446779,0.009276726,0.11665731,-0.15762964,0.01714468,0.12112906,0.0024116468,-0.046937913,0.072817884,0.003063973,-0.073482454,-0.0109879,0.07691085,0.014615729,0.07390326,0.12050373,0.010575533,-0.17096607,0.044830315,-0.15124862,0.100789055,-0.066794336,-0.024629503,0.08389011,-0.13678342,-0.021771677,0.067959756,0.26092067,-0.11384863,-0.049411118,-0.08386374,-0.048946097,-0.025839383,-0.111514,-0.022907494,-0.115315065,-0.075184956,0.127