	(4272, 'Emissão de Boleto e Nota Fiscal, Envio de NF e Boleto (NF)', 'FATURAMENTO', 'Emultec', 'Objetivo: Geração dos documentos financeiros oficiais no sistema. Fluxo Passo a Passo: 1. Abrir o Emultec. 2. Movimentos > Cirurgias > Procurar pelo Nome do paciente ou ID da Cirurgia. 3. Ir em ''Material Utilizado-Pós''. 4. Conferir os valores de acordo com a autorização do faturamento. 5. Conferir todos os dados do paciente. 6. Ir na Aba Notas Fiscais > NF e Venda. 7. Clicar em Cirurgias \\ Avulsos > Ir em Parcelas e colocar o número de parcelas. 8. Clicar em Gerar Parcela. 9. Editar o registro. 10. Clicar no botão ao lado de ''Peso Liq''. 11. Ir em dados adicionais > Preencher de acordo com a nota fiscal (dados bancarios) > Gravar. 12. Ir em NF Gerenciamento > Conectar > Criar XML > Validar > Apertar em DANFE > Verificar os dados > Transmitir XML > Apertar icone de PDF. 13. Mandar pro cliente.', '[-0.09924228,0.17524946,-0.17241973,-0.07312387,-0.067075506,0.012110852,0.06968576,0.17002669,-0.08145707,0.047837276,-0.021156326,-0.069508746,0.051976815,0.040855296,-0.19839504,-0.14659527,-0.14352396,-0.027304769,0.08555585,0.088561684,0.0342284,0.05091582,0.10614739,-0.06559768,-0.07200529,0.0545779,-0.11357773,0.008714795,-0.06883454,-0.34013414,0.12695035,-0.030844659,-0.06300539,-0.0023234906,0.1749106,-0.08562044,-0.048960187,0.13244832,-0.014968966,-0.0025021657,-0.078110516,-0.1524061,0.059410952,0.09194004,0.08978372,0.057844095,-0.039796412,0.020043159,-0.1436213,0.1680198,-0.07953584,-0.17110044,-0.08105116,0.17105868,0.12948877,0.12549104,0.115229994,-0.072201,-0.21369874,0.014598191,0.027321845,0.079402,-0.11096239,0.13095365,0.007168673,0.15023836,0.1345051,-0.045728736,-0.0025658011,0.12439576,-0.13061234,-0.06580669,-0.041186202,-0.020695984,0.117785335,0.028293628,-0.019526564,0.10410985,1.6892329e-05,-0.060196713,0.13607794,0.042731367,-0.14561906,-0.029300213,0.10003483,0.19029884,0.09520487,0.049914736,-0.1155191,-0.08261582,0.14738965,-0.024481963,0.1