	(4302, 'Conferência de Cirurgias', 'ORÇAMENTO - MEDIC', 'Emultec', '1. Conferência de Cirurgias: 1. Abrir o Emultec. 2. Ir em Estoque > Cirurgia Agendadas > Filtrar por data(1 semana anterior). 3. Clicar em ''Ver todos'' e exportar em Excel. 4. Filtrar por representantes(vendedores). 5. Verificar comandas pelo fluxo de região, caso não teve material utilizado tira do sistema. 6. Caso tenha material utilizado ir em Movimentos > Cirurgias. 7. Coloca o nome do paciente > Anexos. 8. Anexar a comanda e encaminhar comanda impressa para logística para dar baixa', '[-0.0568226,0.1605106,-0.09718564,-0.023592353,-0.20906968,-0.020015553,-0.15869784,0.09381278,-0.036519464,0.112385854,-0.04130721,0.035253182,0.0905628,0.0032612085,-0.28255945,-0.37431145,-0.03746662,-0.114563406,0.05559822,0.0080878325,0.0006841626,-0.06990496,-0.0032748133,-0.07885838,-0.05056098,-0.027112067,-0.17062685,-0.07167197,-0.08318077,-0.3616234,-0.091192186,-0.021972805,0.13403535,0.072769076,0.27590877,-0.082482204,-0.12178767,0.0064014792,-0.12712854,0.13368863,-0.05090785,-0.2766984,-0.063733324,0.08173305,0.20833357,0.0044992417,-0.12103751,-0.07470842,-0.21288842,0.18813142,-0.095562994,-0.066981494,-0.068333134,0.05224903,0.04753624,0.042412616,-0.10484183,0.13244179,-0.07153377,0.05168647,0.022235528,0.041204777,-0.24470264,0.24599749,-0.20682502,0.15026383,0.2687446,0.22841072,-0.029255282,0.025894552,0.013589665,-0.089769006,-0.17133708,0.028782383,0.13496688,0.023150742,-0.114519626,0.026225165,0.019607782,-0.11014485,0.13129543,0.06977322,-0.21676482,-0.018445823,0.03712234,0.06373441,0.10142928,-0.0035404563,0.028299239,-0.29464343,0.1428662,-0.10639119,0.044403747,-0.09226898,-0.14711852,0.03782271,-0.14185977,-0.010449961,0.3245207,0.25507846,-0.05748029,-0.089262396,-0.079088405,-0.02740042,-0.1457648,-0.093842156,0.10763138,-0.049330115,-0.036619306,0.23481524,-0.12508261,0.10292901,0.03226725,-0.27681378,-0.041528925,0.31252325,0.057853524,0.2056643,0.15121555,0.013284996,-0.0910