	(4303, 'Orçamento Pós-Cirurgia', 'ORÇAMENTO - MEDIC', 'Emultec', '1. Copiar o ID do paciente do sistema. 2. Ir em Cadastro > Cirurgia > Procura pelos dados do paciente(nome ou ID) e verificar se tem baixa. 3. Ir em ''Material Utilizado-Pós'' se tiver a comanda pode-se valorizar. 4. Conferir comanda com a baixa. 5. Verificar os valores e apertar em Precificado. 6. Colocar no Porta do cliente, email.', '[-0.2346562,0.26686698,-0.07228552,-0.039805565,-0.27476737,0.023888666,0.1490388,0.25367188,-0.07586448,0.11011932,-0.029804517,0.021877078,0.08302022,0.14013334,-0.2801267,-0.2950305,-0.111860424,0.013641262,0.17906483,0.017916566,-0.057033636,-0.02044497,0.16422813,-0.24616975,-0.01576092,0.09324722,-0.07180264,0.010499096,-0.07845936,-0.26058832,0.11109305,-0.08397393,0.18923385,-0.16379532,0.22180535,-0.06704491,-0.040653992,0.15022461,-0.03733799,0.13883375,-0.083401114,-0.15089759,-0.15470557,0.13703021,0.1745709,-0.016305761,-0.05371628,-0.14502312,-0.22630192,0.43360537,-0.17186436,-0.05330784,-0.054708004,0.13913225,0.023526935,0.07672546,0.058470964,-0.15869358,-0.15219921,0.13813864,-0.038702738,-0.007829876,-0.101968914,0.21621086,-0.13284561,0.22045285,0.21762124,-0.10807262,0.107936785,-0.14992934,-0.057631183,-0.098168254,-0.055283543,-0.06805041,0.05795571,0.004534836,0.065348834,0.13683662,0.09781155,-0.092777036,0.1469559,0.13806905,-0.08709849,-0.012600708,0.005632181,0.056545563,0.08459421,0.12931712,-0.15263045,-0.14873756,0.20368609,-0.05336029,-0.0044655274,-0.0636174,-0.1041787,0.07235912,-0.12287948,-0.030287247,0.051450253,0.21144576,-0.019229617,-0.015570755,-0.108785726,0.1399426,-0.065791994,-0.06993765,0.13688679,-0.097152345,-0.06863067,0.021201516,-0.010658073,0.31202057,0.0780184,-0.15920858,-0.15602328,0.35199645,-0.054072585,0.1768169,0.20355442,-0.04954418,-0.068165146,0.066527404,-0.02426754,-0.047320504,0.20700958,-0.21201026,0.090251304,-0.043393556,0.23734303,-0.21924561,0.15048008,-0.0029133845,-0.11534702,0.05735247,0.0388487