	(4304, 'Fluxo de cadastro', 'ORÇAMENTO - MEDIC', 'Vários', 'Objetivo: Garantir que hospitais, convênios e médicos estejam corretamente cadastrados no sistema. Cadastro de Hospital ou Convênio (Cliente): 1. Acessar: Cadastro > Clientes > Novo. 2. Inserir o CNPJ e clicar na bolinha de busca. 3. Conferir as informações. Se o cliente será faturado diretamente, marcar como Cliente Final. Se for hospital, é obrigatório vinculá-lo às cirurgias. Vinculação do Hospital às Cirurgias: 1. Acessar: Movimentos > Comercial. 2. Abrir qualquer cirurgia. 3. No cabeçalho, localizar o campo Hospital. 4. Clicar na lupa e importar o CNPJ. Cadastro apenas do Convênio: Convênios > Novo > Inserir nome e salvar. Cadastro de Médico: 1. Clicar na lupa ao lado do campo Médico. 2. Selecionar Novo. 3. Preencher obrigatoriamente: Nome, CRM, Cidade, Estado, Vendedor.', '[-0.069312304,0.122071624,-0.09846621,-0.27260232,-0.10018565,-0.12833741,0.005336065,0.20279413,0.007126108,0.072603196,-0.039125,0.012349516,-0.0037450697,0.058176383,-0.25107735,-0.19835055,-0.056213975,0.040615518,0.029611148,0.08634556,-0.07312155,-0.06562394,0.0054017454,-0.0802917,-0.11716409,0.064855404,-0.18817946,-0.006004378,-0.033033535,-0.3577529,-0.009818137,-0.073629335,0.045234136,-0.0028398335,0.15546864,-0.13306262,-0.07552392,0.22820114,-0.03964193,0.046925098,-0.055149034,-0.11630949,-0.0005233735,0.022693828,0.0812514,-0.017010259,-0.06924565,0.009293109,-0.12734479,0.22610997,-0.10877633,-0.08670202,0.019583449,0.23909563,0.029847864,0.16305044,0.021850638,-0.061741523,-0.071988896,0.14711344,0.20603459,-0.08788556,-0.10373497,0.15068318,-0.0012910664,0.05392751,0.02972132,0.01607468,0.055436775,0.155294,-0.05928999,-0.037667505,-0.101841554,-0.02896823,0.051279888,-0.025616467,0.00027649105,0.112552695,-0.027855745,0.053008795,0.10865036,0.002228409,-0.04291524,-0.124656975,0.008957524,0.12368742,-0.0050350325,0.16046935,-0.10826547,-0.2613861,-0.030848281,-0.07274334,0.14763391,-0.1309143,0.0103725325,0.0963