	(4332, 'Fluxo de agendamento de cirurgias', 'ORÇAMENTO - MEDIC', 'Vários', 'Objetivo: Registrar corretamente todos os agendamentos. 1. Acessar: Movimentos > Comercial > Novo. 2. Inserir todas as informações recebidas (Data, Hora, Parte do corpo, Tipo de cirurgia, Médico, Hospital, Convênio, Representante). Cirurgia Eletiva: Conferir se o agendamento está de acordo com a autorização > Marcar como Aprovado > Confirmar agendamento > Clicar no capacete para sincronização. Cirurgia de Urgência: Criar novo cadastro > Inserir informações > Marcar como Aprovado > Confirmar agendamento > Clicar no capacete. Se o markup (margem) estiver baixo, solicitar aprovação da coordenação.', '[0.020711109,0.13451457,-0.107976586,-0.0724973,-0.1126101,-0.05010859,0.020708876,0.05949101,-0.0931899,0.096051335,-0.00030409172,0.064406216,0.036025424,0.042551357,-0.16060132,-0.17183751,-0.027478043,-0.09151674,0.002999276,0.04226072,0.01761131,-0.03136212,0.118259765,-0.059539713,-0.11760474,-0.044634633,-0.11473048,-0.03107052,-0.07476171,-0.29880542,0.05125879,-0.017222032,0.16055265,0.010829236,0.108311616,0.012264773,-0.07445315,0.16366012,-0.031144492,0.109376624,-0.055712707,-0.24755074,-0.045609485,0.05033554,0.08915714,0.050908387,-0.12054607,-0.017650623,-0.2479021,0.18968299,-0.15208879,-0.2057862,-0.05546259,0.13384342,0.094183825,0.052745044,0.029194325,0.0068847723,-0.025425583,0.09131193,0.09614169,0.01372005,-0.11423659,0.15106572,-0.10311416,0.04121714,0.09174988,0.0062931255,0.004404351,0.14180727,0.0017942786,-0.018338501,-0.006734848,0.013538398,0.10722834,-0.13873622,0.012925623,0.118127875,0.019165678,-0.03708504,0.08543478,-0.006220244,-0.0692534,-0.005328726,0.05628506,0.01417351,0.05179796,0.0936113,0.002332572,-0.16529322,0.022620887,-0.1340571,0.09501604,-0.06144735,-0.010618553,0.07549596,-0.13763303,-0.019880772,0.061213493,0.24708498,-0.115201145,-0.033180967,-0.06637654,-0.029345542,-0.022643274,-0.107542284,-0.01645105,-0.109463155,-0.053503066,0.110168666,-0.