	(4342, 'Fluxo de Visualização de Nota Fiscal', 'ORÇAMENTO - ARTHROMED', 'Emultec', 'Caminho 1 - Pela Visualização Geral: 1. Habilitar o servidor. 2. Acessar: Movimentos > Visualização. 3. Clicar em NF e inserir a numeração. 4. Abrir a nota com dois cliques. 5. Conectar ao servidor. 6. Visualizar DANFE ou PDF. Caminho 2 - Pela Cirurgia: 1. Acessar: Movimentos > Comercial > Visualização. 2. Abrir a cirurgia desejada. 3. Acessar a aba Nota Fiscal. 4. Clicar na nota. 5. Conectar ao servidor. 6. Gerar o DANFE.', '[-0.0381786,0.04143484,0.061500132,0.024012208,-0.04644547,0.1192396,-0.05176452,-0.033436857,0.018990941,0.20693448,-0.048739254,-0.10092987,-0.0152906375,0.08644146,-0.04195255,-0.24466586,-0.058937274,0.07421228,0.10860148,0.13876328,0.093090706,-0.0833019,-0.03168276,-0.26361376,0.0020433106,0.1801241,-0.09419764,-0.2263422,-0.0026321113,-0.38540387,0.03019019,0.036634907,0.03339626,0.08460688,0.11531004,-0.16988346,0.026128374,0.11729749,0.095199116,-0.044203445,-0.1802086,-0.039329402,0.007130161,-0.09486097,0.112265676,-0.032815713,-0.078390375,0.04763656,-0.081798255,0.020943463,-0.30246568,-0.14556745,-0.06399528,-0.02189897,0.15463302,0.14917725,0.20330171,0.086518586,0.019788083,-0.06589374,0.17703842,-0.025805369,-0.069745004,-0.03270959,0.0462624,0.19909252,0.14382915,-0.081321806,-0.009501755,-0.032939836,-0.10360613,-0.20138389,-0.13752188,-0.22860205,0.06836089,-0.10884304,-0.05796255,0.19675481,-0.05666962,-0.24669361,-0.056675583,0.09999457,-0.14523916,0.12973256,0.1548997,0.16607879,0.039318915,0.026556171,-0.06419398,0.15198278,0.08455557,-0.106681496,-0.019614294,-0.030196927,-0.032133132,-0.031716853,0.018268362,-0.20009859,0.21872747,0.31407252,-0.051948823,0.11424644,0.10995355,-0.037207603,0.10946514,-0.08752414,0.13995123,0.08021888,-0.054890677,0.037794795,0.09453436,0.21342416,-0.115501136,-0.13797238,0.003941655,0.15652314,-0.12879673,-0.06965373,0.37719834,0.1476937,0.11432931,0.030955896,-0.08927356,-0.018409014,0.07407212,-0.2895