	(64, '[SETOR: Comercial] [PROCESSO: Processo de Negociação de Orçamento / Novos Valores]
Setores envolvidos: Hospital/Convênio, Comercial Interno e Coordenação. Objetivo: Ajustar e validar valores orçados através de negociações entre a empresa e o cliente. Passo a Passo: 1. Observar orçamento. 2. Entrar no Sistema Emultec em Movimentos > Cirurgias. 3. Procurar paciente, e após isso, clicar em ''Material Utilizado Pós'' e verificar. 4. Apertar as teclas de uma vez: Fn + Alt + F9 > Produtos > Pesquisar o código do material e ver o custo.', '{"setor": "Comercial", "processo": "Processo de Negociação de Orçamento / Novos Valores"}', '[-0.05545044,0.0014925003,0.028289795,-0.025054932,-0.04043579,0.017318726,-0.0030231476,0.045318604,-0.051239014,-0.049743652,0.055419922,-0.04159546,-0.008834839,0.0035152435,0.06384277,0.018081665,-0.009231567,-0.011123657,-0.06695557,0.00047445297,0.02571106,0.0035800934,0.0032539368,-0.035491943,0.00038027763,-0.054779053,-0.017822266,-0.008338928,0.0027675629,-0.048980713,-0.004852295,-0.0138549805,-0.0046577454,-0.0024204254,-0.04373169,0.010215759,-0.05621338,0.037719727,0.014778137,0.023086548,-0.01171875,0.046691895,-0.017684937,-0.017562866,0.020843506,0.011100769,-0.028839111,-0.058898926,0.044525146,-0.025146484,0.0129776,0.02558899,0.017578125,-0.027679443,0.033416748,-0.0056648254,0.007221222,-0.0184021,0.04525757,0.015281677,0.04550171,-0.0446167,0.017608643,0.00907135,-0.033843994,0.03805542,-0.042785645,0.0385437,0.018661499,-0.010147095,-0.061462402,0.024337769,-0.018417358,-0.03817749,0.05392456,-0.043121338,-0.009765625,0.00554657,0.0090408325,-0.012756348,-0.0041885376,-0.009780884,-0.008148193,0.0569458,-0.015853882,-0.011711121,-0.10253906,-0.026947021,-0.022766113,-0.026260376,-0.056793213,0.02017212,0.003780365,0.051086426,0.0132751465,0.004852295,-0.06542969,-0.041107178,0.03942871,0.04586792,0.033721924,-0.04046631,0.0519104,0.009483337,-0.012176514,0.024856567,-0.0046691895,0.0008087158,0.016189575,-0.00016057491,0.035339355,0.0015134811,-0.02507019,0.03967285,0.06518555,0.009117126,-0.00044488907,0