	(69, '[SETOR: Orçamento - Medic] [PROCESSO: Orçamento Prévio]
1. Verificar plataformas(Whatsapp, Gmail, OMPnexo, Inpart, Gtplan, EMS). 2. No Gtplan ir em Cotações OPME > Limpar Filtros > Colocar UF > Pesquisar. 3. Se o status estiver em ''aberto'' cotar. 4. Copiar ID do paciente e seus dados. 5. Mandar para o representante da área para saber se vai cotar. 6. Se for para cotar: Abrir Emultec > Movimentos > Cirurgias > Cadastro > Clicar no ícone de papel e preencher os dados com base no portal. 7. Ir em Orçamentos > Clicar no icone de papel > Gera o ID de Orçamento > Adicionar produtos avulsos ou conjunto > Sincronizar com SysWeb. 8. Colocar ID do produto no Gtplan. 9. Finalizar proposta.', '{"setor": "Orçamento - Medic", "processo": "Orçamento Prévio"}', '[-0.037872314,0.005130768,0.024551392,0.0022277832,-0.037719727,0.0019817352,-0.0041160583,0.035736084,-0.020767212,-0.038726807,0.042999268,-0.055419922,0.007610321,0.009346008,0.04925537,0.010528564,-0.007881165,-0.025939941,-0.07110596,0.031021118,0.018447876,0.006919861,-0.008232117,-0.056427002,-0.029205322,-0.055358887,-0.0063476562,-0.015853882,-0.017684937,-0.02255249,-0.01209259,-0.015945435,-0.0042915344,-0.0019683838,-0.043945312,0.021133423,-0.050872803,0.05606079,0.029144287,0.02482605,-0.021957397,0.036743164,-0.0013685226,0.0049705505,0.014183044,0.012123108,-0.016220093,-0.0625,0.04135132,-0.032989502,0.032440186,0.03753662,-0.0077819824,0.011932373,0.0014867783,-0.02017212,0.008850098,0.0022277832,0.032104492,0.024902344,0.029281616,-0.027938843,0.005455017,0.028564453,-0.031921387,0.009605408,-0.016815186,0.028137207,-0.014381409,0.024658203,-0.072021484,0.023147583,-0.0024299622,-0.019714355,0.0569458,-0.047790527,-0.020462036,0.017715454,0.018051147,0.0038108826,-0.010604858,-0.023544312,-0.025726318,0.023620605,-0.021850586,-0.021972656,-0.083496094,-0.02456665,-0.02897644,-0.008720398,-0.05203247,0.015853882,-0.019943237,0.05682373,0.01600647,0.03656006,-0.039764404,-0.0093688965,0.006679535,0.0418396,0.07684326,-0.041381836,0.0028743744,-0.0036888123,-0.