	(72, '[SETOR: Orçamento - Medic] [PROCESSO: Fluxo de cadastro]
Objetivo: Garantir que hospitais, convênios e médicos estejam corretamente cadastrados no sistema. Cadastro de Hospital ou Convênio (Cliente): 1. Acessar: Cadastro > Clientes > Novo. 2. Inserir o CNPJ e clicar na bolinha de busca. 3. Conferir as informações. Se o cliente será faturado diretamente, marcar como Cliente Final. Se for hospital, é obrigatório vinculá-lo às cirurgias. Vinculação do Hospital às Cirurgias: 1. Acessar: Movimentos > Comercial. 2. Abrir qualquer cirurgia. 3. No cabeçalho, localizar o campo Hospital. 4. Clicar na lupa e importar o CNPJ. Cadastro apenas do Convênio: Convênios > Novo > Inserir nome e salvar. Cadastro de Médico: 1. Clicar na lupa ao lado do campo Médico. 2. Selecionar Novo. 3. Preencher obrigatoriamente: Nome, CRM, Cidade, Estado, Vendedor.', '{"setor": "Orçamento - Medic", "processo": "Fluxo de cadastro"}', '[-0.05883789,0.009941101,0.011688232,0.007827759,-0.038513184,0.014282227,-0.021560669,0.019607544,-0.045135498,-0.039276123,0.03289795,-0.038391113,0.024093628,0.007949829,0.041412354,0.042053223,-0.025894165,-0.01625061,-0.05001831,0.006893158,0.026519775,0.014968872,0.021255493,-0.021759033,-0.02456665,-0.046173096,-0.024917603,-0.0008530617,0.005268097,-0.035186768,0.024917603,-0.01209259,-0.008552551,0.011459351,-0.024765015,0.020751953,-0.01259613,0.044311523,0.005302429,0.020889282,-0.013206482,0.057250977,0.013893127,0.0058059692,0.045959473,0.008506775,-0.029464722,-0.089782715,0.008232117,0.0032157898,-0.019943237,0.027877808,-0.008110046,0.00013554096,0.0135650635,-0.0026111603,9.828806e-05,-0.012229919,0.017501831,0.008857727,0.040802002,-0.031402588,0.00048351288,0.035095215,-0.018478394,0.043548584,-0.054840088,0.046081543,0.0061302185,0.006549835,-0.068603516,0.04647827,0.017028809,-0.013809204,0.046691895,-0.057769775,-0.007282257,0.020507812,0.028656006,-0.0020198822,-0.0024929047,-0.008682251,-0.022003174,0.0069885254,-0.01914978,-0.0011548996,-0.09503174,-0.010681152,-0.009414673,-0.01763916,-0.037322998,0.