	(76, '[SETOR: Orçamento - Arthromed] [PROCESSO: Orçamento Prévio]
1. Verificar WhatsApp, e-mails e portais. 2. Para acessar os portais existe uma tabela com senha e login: Abra o explorador de arquivos do notebook > pasta ''office 2-Pessoal'' > pesquisar por ''senhas'' > abrir o Excel ''Senhas portais''. 3. Avisar ao vendedor sobre a solicitação com as informações: IDC do paciente, Nome, Médico, Convênio e Hospital. 4. Abrir o Emultec (Movimentos > Comercial > Cadastro > Novo > Clicar no ícone do papel antes de preencher o cabeçalho). OBS: A data da cirurgia só deve ser preenchida APÓS a autorização do orçamento/agendamento. Regras: Se não souber o médico, perguntar ao hospital; se não souber a parte do corpo, confirmar com coordenação. Conferir representante e gerente. 5. Clicar no ícone de produtos avulsos ou conjuntos. 6. Após adicionar os produtos/conjuntos, verificar se estão de acordo com a solicitação. 7. Clicar no ícone de parâmetros e depois clicar no capacete para sincronizar com o Sysweb. 8. Lançar as informações no portal. Antes de enviar a proposta no portal, comparar se o valor está correto.', '{"setor": "Orçamento - Arthromed", "processo": "Orçamento Prévio"}', '[-0.018051147,0.0041046143,0.007183075,0.0064201355,-0.027816772,0.00434494,-0.016815186,0.003326416,-0.036987305,-0.03488159,0.010650635,-0.06088257,0.009429932,0.011650085,0.04901123,0.03466797,0.0053749084,-0.027801514,-0.059173584,0.01576233,0.010307312,0.026992798,-0.022460938,-0.03640747,-0.036102295,-0.040008545,-0.012313843,-0.010131836,0.020935059,-0.042816162,-0.03579712,-0.014541626,0.015586853,0.008712769,-0.042419434,0.04736328,-0.03945923,0.046936035,0.018585205,0.015823364,0.005004883,0.0546875,-0.003364563,0.047912598,0.022750854,-0.0026664734,-0.037750244,-0.061553955,0.04309082,-0.03074646,0.044403076,0.05340576,0.001241684,0.0385437,-0.011619568,-0.006477356,0.014289856,0.011474609,0.029541016,0.01612854,0.0211792,-0.025375366,-0.022903442,-0.0010490417,-0.04397583,-0.010261536,-0.018478394,0.04949951,-0.0021190643,-0.008010864,-0.06951904