	(80, '[SETOR: Orçamento - Arthromed] [PROCESSO: Fluxo de Cadastro]
Objetivo: Garantir que hospitais, convênios e médicos estejam corretamente cadastrados no sistema. Cadastro de Hospital ou Convênio (Cliente): 1. Acessar: Cadastro > Clientes > Novo. 2. Inserir o CNPJ e clicar na bolinha de busca. 3. Conferir as informações. Se o cliente será faturado diretamente, marcar como Cliente Final. Se for hospital, é obrigatório vinculá-lo às cirurgias. Vinculação do Hospital às Cirurgias: 1. Acessar: Movimentos > Comercial. 2. Abrir qualquer cirurgia. 3. No cabeçalho, localizar o campo Hospital. 4. Clicar na lupa e importar o CNPJ. Cadastro apenas do Convênio: Convênios > Novo > Inserir nome e salvar. Cadastro de Médico: 1. Clicar na lupa ao lado do campo Médico. 2. Selecionar Novo. 3. Preencher obrigatoriamente: Nome, CRM, Cidade, Estado, Vendedor.', '{"setor": "Orçamento - Arthromed", "processo": "Fluxo de Cadastro"}', '[-0.057525635,0.0056915283,0.01687622,0.0055351257,-0.039764404,0.021270752,-0.02822876,0.006374359,-0.04135132,-0.03652954,0.02659607,-0.03881836,0.026245117,0.005996704,0.037628174,0.045288086,-0.03152466,-0.016296387,-0.0491333,0.0061149597,0.034362793,0.017913818,0.018341064,-0.025726318,-0.01940918,-0.044128418,-0.03466797,-0.0077819824,0.0007381439,-0.035980225,0.023391724,-0.014778137,0.004081726,0.013618469,-0.034454346,0.028762817,-0.019927979,0.040283203,0.0060806274,0.013160706,-0.0035686493,0.06185913,0.0074424744,0.012802124,0.041229248,0.004211426,-0.034057617,-0.08734131,0.011146545,0.0007915497,-0.024230957,0.026062012,-0.0038909912,-0.0032844543,-0.000538826,-0.0053100586,0.0013694763,-0.008979797,0.02079773,0.0066108704,0.037231445,-0.029464722,-0.00079631805,0.0209198,-0.026489258,0.04244995,-0.053985596,0.05419922,0.012496948,0.011878967,-0.06878662,0.045288086,0.019943237,-0.014251709,0.035827637,-0.054107666,-0.014587402,0.02178955,0.04348755,0.008712769,-0.008583069,-0.0090408325,-0.019943237,0.011695862,-0.016815186,-0.009475708,-0.09509277,-0.0042762756,-0.009986877,-0.015312195,-0.032562256,0.024