	(122, '[SETOR: Comercial] [PROCESSO: Processo de Negociação de Orçamento / Novos Valores]
Setores envolvidos: Hospital/Convênio, Comercial Interno e Coordenação. Objetivo: Ajustar e validar valores orçados através de negociações entre a empresa e o cliente. Passo a Passo: 1. Observar orçamento. 2. Entrar no Sistema Emultec em Movimentos > Cirurgias. 3. Procurar paciente, e após isso, clicar em ''Material Utilizado Pós'' e verificar. 4. Apertar as teclas de uma vez: Fn + Alt + F9 > Produtos > Pesquisar o código do material e ver o custo.', '{"setor": "Comercial", "processo": "Processo de Negociação de Orçamento / Novos Valores"}', '[-0.055419922,0.0014886856,0.02835083,-0.024963379,-0.04046631,0.017303467,-0.0029411316,0.045288086,-0.05117798,-0.049713135,0.05545044,-0.04159546,-0.008895874,0.0035095215,0.06378174,0.018051147,-0.009132385,-0.011100769,-0.06689453,0.00045251846,0.025741577,0.0035705566,0.003162384,-0.035491943,0.0004005432,-0.05480957,-0.0178833,-0.008331299,0.0026874542,-0.048950195,-0.00484848,-0.01386261,-0.0047340393,-0.0024642944,-0.043701172,0.010253906,-0.05621338,0.03765869,0.0146865845,0.023132324,-0.011672974,0.046691895,-0.017623901,-0.017456055,0.02079773,0.011177063,-0.028808594,-0.058898926,0.044525146,-0.025161743,0.013053894,0.025665283,0.01751709,-0.027664185,0.033477783,-0.005706787,0.007171631,-0.018417358,0.04522705,0.015266418,0.04547119,-0.04458618,0.017623901,0.009063721,-0.033813477,0.037994385,-0.04296875,0.0385437,0.018600464,-0.010215759,-0.061523438,0.024414062,-0.0184021,-0.038146973,0.053985596,-0.043182373,-0.009681702,0.0055503845,0.009002686,-0.012611389,-0.0042648315,-0.009735107,-0.008224487,0.0569458,-0.015838623,-0.011726379,-0.10253906,-0.026947021,-0.02281189,-0.026321411,-0.056793213,0.020187378,0.0037002563,0.05102539,0.0132369995,0.0048561096,-0.06555176,-0.041046143,0.039398193,0.045806885,0.03366089,-0.04043579,0.0519104,0.009490967,-0.012084961,0.024856567,-0.0045661926,0.00081300735,0.016220093,-0.00013887882,0.035461426,0.001531601,-0.025054932,0.03970337,0.06518555,0.009094238,-0.00039863586,