	(125, '[SETOR: Faturamento] [PROCESSO: Emissão de Boleto e Nota Fiscal, Envio de NF e Boleto (NF)]
Objetivo: Geração dos documentos financeiros oficiais no sistema. Fluxo Passo a Passo: 1. Abrir o Emultec. 2. Movimentos > Cirurgias > Procurar pelo Nome do paciente ou ID da Cirurgia. 3. Ir em ''Material Utilizado-Pós''. 4. Conferir os valores de acordo com a autorização do faturamento. 5. Conferir todos os dados do paciente. 6. Ir na Aba Notas Fiscais > NF e Venda. 7. Clicar em Cirurgias \\ Avulsos > Ir em Parcelas e colocar o número de parcelas. 8. Clicar em Gerar Parcela. 9. Editar o registro. 10. Clicar no botão ao lado de ''Peso Liq''. 11. Ir em dados adicionais > Preencher de acordo com a nota fiscal (dados bancarios) > Gravar. 12. Ir em NF Gerenciamento > Conectar > Criar XML > Validar > Apertar em DANFE > Verificar os dados > Transmitir XML > Apertar icone de PDF. 13. Mandar pro cliente.', '{"setor": "Faturamento", "processo": "Emissão de Boleto e Nota Fiscal, Envio de NF e Boleto (NF)"}', '[-0.013175964,0.019729614,0.029296875,-0.02217102,-0.018035889,0.0014677048,-0.009315491,-0.008255005,-0.033081055,-0.013549805,0.024795532,-0.026412964,-0.04611206,-0.02911377,0.03552246,0.037841797,0.022491455,-0.024658203,-0.036132812,0.0029907227,0.053009033,0.0015077591,0.0184021,-0.05078125,-0.034057617,-0.07458496,-0.04360962,-0.008125305,-0.007698059,-0.048431396,-0.006038666,-0.012237549,0.03692627,-0.0057029724,-0.059661865,0.03933716,-0.0071029663,0.035308838,0.009895325,0.035186768,0.0033683777,0.028411865,-0.0033817291,-0.008491516,0.008934021,0.045166016,0.0003068447,-0.03225708,0.06335449,0.009986877,0.028335571,0.057373047,-0.023223877,0.018493652,-0.019134521,-0.0027313232,-0.031799316,-0.022705078,0.010696411,0.0043754578,0.05319214,-0.018936157,0.01171875,0.014640808,-0.011734009,0.030258179,-0.054260254,0.040863037,0.010612488,0.017227173,-0.03955078,0.026733398,-0.0023441315,-0.0049057007,0.052093506,-0.036712646,0.0066108704,-0.013427734,0.004043579,-0.0231781,0.011924744,-0.009674072,-0.02558899,0.050628662,-0.0004799366,-0.024353027,-0.121154785,0