	(127, '[SETOR: Orçamento - Medic] [PROCESSO: Orçamento Prévio]
1. Verificar plataformas(Whatsapp, Gmail, OMPnexo, Inpart, Gtplan, EMS). 2. No Gtplan ir em Cotações OPME > Limpar Filtros > Colocar UF > Pesquisar. 3. Se o status estiver em ''aberto'' cotar. 4. Copiar ID do paciente e seus dados. 5. Mandar para o representante da área para saber se vai cotar. 6. Se for para cotar: Abrir Emultec > Movimentos > Cirurgias > Cadastro > Clicar no ícone de papel e preencher os dados com base no portal. 7. Ir em Orçamentos > Clicar no icone de papel > Gera o ID de Orçamento > Adicionar produtos avulsos ou conjunto > Sincronizar com SysWeb. 8. Colocar ID do produto no Gtplan. 9. Finalizar proposta.', '{"setor": "Orçamento - Medic", "processo": "Orçamento Prévio"}', '[-0.037902832,0.0050811768,0.024520874,0.0022621155,-0.037719727,0.0020103455,-0.0041389465,0.0357666,-0.020828247,-0.038726807,0.043029785,-0.055419922,0.007637024,0.009246826,0.04928589,0.010513306,-0.007873535,-0.026016235,-0.07110596,0.0309906,0.018356323,0.006965637,-0.008224487,-0.056427002,-0.029220581,-0.055267334,-0.0063171387,-0.01576233,-0.01763916,-0.02255249,-0.012107849,-0.0158844,-0.004295349,-0.0020217896,-0.04397583,0.021102905,-0.050842285,0.056121826,0.029129028,0.024841309,-0.021911621,0.03668213,-0.001458168,0.0050315857,0.0141067505,0.012062073,-0.01625061,-0.062438965,0.04135132,-0.032989502,0.032470703,0.03753662,-0.0077667236,0.011955261,0.0014371872,-0.020187378,0.008804321,0.0022640228,0.03213501,0.024871826,0.029205322,-0.027862549,0.0054893494,0.028518677,-0.03189087,0.00957489,-0.01676941,0.028182983,-0.0143966675,0.024612427,-0.072143555,0.023132324,-0.0025138855,-0.019729614,0.056884766,-0.04776001,-0.020523071,0.017745972,0.018096924,0.0037288666,-0.010498047,-0.023544312,-0.025726318,0.023742676,-0.021835327,-0.022003174,-0.083496094,-0.024612427,-0.0289917,-0.008743286,-0.051971436,0.015838623,-0.019882202,0.05682373,0.016036987,0.03656006,-0.039764404,-0.0093688965,0.006679535,0.041809082,0.07678223,-0.04135132,0.0028514862,-0.0037288666,-0.