	(130, '[SETOR: Orçamento - Medic] [PROCESSO: Fluxo de cadastro]
Objetivo: Garantir que hospitais, convênios e médicos estejam corretamente cadastrados no sistema. Cadastro de Hospital ou Convênio (Cliente): 1. Acessar: Cadastro > Clientes > Novo. 2. Inserir o CNPJ e clicar na bolinha de busca. 3. Conferir as informações. Se o cliente será faturado diretamente, marcar como Cliente Final. Se for hospital, é obrigatório vinculá-lo às cirurgias. Vinculação do Hospital às Cirurgias: 1. Acessar: Movimentos > Comercial. 2. Abrir qualquer cirurgia. 3. No cabeçalho, localizar o campo Hospital. 4. Clicar na lupa e importar o CNPJ. Cadastro apenas do Convênio: Convênios > Novo > Inserir nome e salvar. Cadastro de Médico: 1. Clicar na lupa ao lado do campo Médico. 2. Selecionar Novo. 3. Preencher obrigatoriamente: Nome, CRM, Cidade, Estado, Vendedor.', '{"setor": "Orçamento - Medic", "processo": "Fluxo de cadastro"}', '[-0.05883789,0.00995636,0.011711121,0.007873535,-0.038513184,0.014266968,-0.021560669,0.019638062,-0.045135498,-0.039215088,0.03289795,-0.03842163,0.024108887,0.007926941,0.041412354,0.042053223,-0.025863647,-0.016220093,-0.05001831,0.006893158,0.026550293,0.014961243,0.021270752,-0.021759033,-0.024536133,-0.046203613,-0.024917603,-0.0008363724,0.005279541,-0.03515625,0.024887085,-0.012107849,-0.008560181,0.011482239,-0.024765015,0.020751953,-0.012611389,0.044311523,0.005290985,0.0209198,-0.01322937,0.057250977,0.013893127,0.005794525,0.045959473,0.008506775,-0.029464722,-0.089782715,0.008262634,0.0031871796,-0.019927979,0.027877808,-0.008087158,0.00013172626,0.013580322,-0.0026073456,9.858608e-05,-0.012260437,0.017486572,0.008872986,0.040802002,-0.031402588,0.00045132637,0.035125732,-0.018463135,0.0435791,-0.054779053,0.046051025,0.0061569214,0.00655365,-0.068603516,0.04650879,0.01701355,-0.013832092,0.046691895,-0.057739258,-0.0072631836,0.020507812,0.028671265,-0.0019893646,-0.0024738312,-0.008659363,-0.022003174,0.007019043,-0.01914978,-0.001156807,-0.09503174,-0.010643005,-0.009429932,-0.017654419,-0.037322998,0.02577209