	(134, '[SETOR: Orçamento - Arthromed] [PROCESSO: Orçamento Prévio]
1. Verificar WhatsApp, e-mails e portais. 2. Para acessar os portais existe uma tabela com senha e login: Abra o explorador de arquivos do notebook > pasta ''office 2-Pessoal'' > pesquisar por ''senhas'' > abrir o Excel ''Senhas portais''. 3. Avisar ao vendedor sobre a solicitação com as informações: IDC do paciente, Nome, Médico, Convênio e Hospital. 4. Abrir o Emultec (Movimentos > Comercial > Cadastro > Novo > Clicar no ícone do papel antes de preencher o cabeçalho). OBS: A data da cirurgia só deve ser preenchida APÓS a autorização do orçamento/agendamento. Regras: Se não souber o médico, perguntar ao hospital; se não souber a parte do corpo, confirmar com coordenação. Conferir representante e gerente. 5. Clicar no ícone de produtos avulsos ou conjuntos. 6. Após adicionar os produtos/conjuntos, verificar se estão de acordo com a solicitação. 7. Clicar no ícone de parâmetros e depois clicar no capacete para sincronizar com o Sysweb. 8. Lançar as informações no portal. Antes de enviar a proposta no portal, comparar se o valor está correto.', '{"setor": "Orçamento - Arthromed", "processo": "Orçamento Prévio"}', '[-0.018066406,0.004096985,0.007118225,0.0064888,-0.02784729,0.004436493,-0.016830444,0.0032310486,-0.036987305,-0.03475952,0.010650635,-0.06088257,0.009315491,0.011695862,0.048950195,0.0345459,0.0052871704,-0.027801514,-0.05923462,0.015731812,0.010299683,0.02684021,-0.022445679,-0.03640747,-0.03604126,-0.040008545,-0.012290955,-0.009963989,0.02104187,-0.042816162,-0.03579712,-0.01448822,0.015571594,0.008590698,-0.0423584,0.047454834,-0.039520264,0.046875,0.018569946,0.0158844,0.0049095154,0.054718018,-0.0034999847,0.04788208,0.02279663,-0.002653122,-0.037841797,-0.061645508,0.04309082,-0.030715942,0.04446411,0.05340576,0.0012664795,0.03857422,-0.011688232,-0.0064430237,0.014335632,0.011642456,0.029434204,0.016113281,0.021224976,-0.02545166,-0.02281189,-0.00092315674,-0.043945312,-0.010314941,-0.018493652,0.049438477,-0.0021800995,-0.0079422,-0.06951904,0.033