	(138, '[SETOR: Orçamento - Arthromed] [PROCESSO: Fluxo de Cadastro]
Objetivo: Garantir que hospitais, convênios e médicos estejam corretamente cadastrados no sistema. Cadastro de Hospital ou Convênio (Cliente): 1. Acessar: Cadastro > Clientes > Novo. 2. Inserir o CNPJ e clicar na bolinha de busca. 3. Conferir as informações. Se o cliente será faturado diretamente, marcar como Cliente Final. Se for hospital, é obrigatório vinculá-lo às cirurgias. Vinculação do Hospital às Cirurgias: 1. Acessar: Movimentos > Comercial. 2. Abrir qualquer cirurgia. 3. No cabeçalho, localizar o campo Hospital. 4. Clicar na lupa e importar o CNPJ. Cadastro apenas do Convênio: Convênios > Novo > Inserir nome e salvar. Cadastro de Médico: 1. Clicar na lupa ao lado do campo Médico. 2. Selecionar Novo. 3. Preencher obrigatoriamente: Nome, CRM, Cidade, Estado, Vendedor.', '{"setor": "Orçamento - Arthromed", "processo": "Fluxo de Cadastro"}', '[-0.057434082,0.00579834,0.01675415,0.0055999756,-0.03982544,0.021469116,-0.028457642,0.0064849854,-0.041168213,-0.03652954,0.026397705,-0.03869629,0.026260376,0.0059814453,0.03756714,0.045288086,-0.03164673,-0.01651001,-0.048950195,0.0059165955,0.03439331,0.01802063,0.0184021,-0.025604248,-0.019256592,-0.043914795,-0.03463745,-0.0076904297,0.0008277893,-0.036254883,0.02357483,-0.014755249,0.0038585663,0.013504028,-0.03427124,0.02885437,-0.019760132,0.040527344,0.005970001,0.013305664,-0.0035648346,0.0619812,0.007457733,0.0126953125,0.041137695,0.0042800903,-0.034332275,-0.08746338,0.010917664,0.00061893463,-0.024246216,0.025848389,-0.0040130615,-0.0032482147,-0.0006799698,-0.0054130554,0.001584053,-0.008842468,0.0206604,0.0066947937,0.03741455,-0.029464722,-0.00081300735,0.021102905,-0.026351929,0.04269409,-0.053771973,0.05404663,0.012268066,0.011764526,-0.06854248,0.045532227,0.019866943,-0.014259338,0.03591919,-0.05429077,-0.0143585205,0.021652222,0.043304443,0.008468628,-0.008804321,-0.009124756,-0.020019531,0.011604309,-0.01687622,-0.009346008,-0.09515381,-0.004295349,-0.009536743,-0.014915466,-0.032409668,0.02424621